Medusa: Tree Attention Verification



Each head generates multiple top predictions:

Head 1: {a₁, a₂, …, aₖ}
Head 2: {b₁, b₂, …, bₖ}
Head 3: {c₁, c₂, …, cₖ}

Construct sparse tree of candidate continuations
Custom attention mask: each token only attends to ancestors in tree
Use appropriate positional encoding for tree structure

Chat Templates
Many models are fine-tuned as chatbots with messages format:
messages = [
    {
        "role": "system",
        "content": "Please classify movie reviews as 'positive' or 'negative'."
    },
    {
        "role": "user",
